#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.bfill.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.bfill"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:1 of
msgid "Backward-fill: propagate the next non-null value backward."
msgstr "向后填充：向后传播下一个非空值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:3 of
msgid ""
"Consecutive nulls are replaced with the next non-null value observed "
"later in the row order.  ``limit <= 0`` raises ``ValueError`` (matching "
"pandas)."
msgstr ""
"连续的空值被行顺序中后面观察到的下一个非空值替换。``limit <= 0`` 会引发 `"
"`ValueError`` （与 pandas 匹配）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:7 of
msgid "Maximum number of consecutive nulls to fill in each run."
msgstr "每次运行中要填充的最大连续空值数量。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:9 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to fill.  If None, all visible columns are filled. Non-selected"
" columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要填充的列。如果为 None，则填充所有可见列。未选择的列保持不变。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:13 of
msgid ""
"Backward-filled LiteFrame with the same shape and columns.  Output dtypes"
" equal the input dtypes (no widening, including decimal)."
msgstr ""
"具有相同形状和列的向后填充 LiteFrame。输出数据类型等于输入数据类型（不"
"进行扩展，包括小数）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:19 of
msgid ":py:obj:`ffill`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:20 of
msgid "Forward-fill missing values."
msgstr "向前填充缺失值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:22 of
msgid ":py:obj:`fillna`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.bfill:23 of
msgid "Fill missing values."
msgstr "填充缺失值。"

